ng with the performer of "All in Love." Since the context does not mention "All in Love," we infer that the question is referring to the performer of "Meet Me in Montana" as the one who also sings "All in Love." Therefore, the answer is Dan Seals, as he is one of the performers of "Meet Me in Montana.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Dan Seals', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The original question asks who sings "Meet Me in Montana" with the performer of "All in Love." First, we identify the performer of "All in Love," which is Marie Osmond. Then, we determine who sings "Meet Me in Montana" with Marie Osmond, which is Dan Seals. Therefore, the final answer is Dan Seals.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Dan Seals', '</answer>\n']}
