he company ceased operations. The context provided states that the White Star Line was "Defunct 1934," which directly indicates the year it went out of business. Therefore, the answer is 1934.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', '1934', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The operator of the SS Baltic was the White Star Line. The White Star Line went out of business in 1934. Therefore, the answer is 1934.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', '1934', '</answer>\n']}
