unty, North Carolina, and that it is located southwest of Lexington. This implies that Lexington is within the same county, Davidson County. Therefore, the answer is Davidson County.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Davidson County', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'To determine the administrative territorial entity where James Madison Leach died, we first identified the location of his death as Lexington. Next, we determined that Lexington is located in Davidson County. Therefore, the administrative territorial entity is Davidson County.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Davidson County', '</answer>\n']}
{'id': 11741, 'user': 'What forest is by the southern border of the city where Jan Białostocki died?', 'assistant': ['<step>\n', 'The original question asks for the name of a forest located by the southern border of the city where Jan Białostocki died. To determine this, I first need to identify the specific city where Jan Białostocki died. This sub-question is the starting point in the reasoning chain, as it provides the necessary location information to proceed with finding the forest in question.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'In what place did Jan Białostocki die?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'Jan Białostocki (born August 14, 1921 in Saratov, Russia; died December 25, 1988 in Warsaw) was one of the most famous Polish art historians of the 20th century.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context states that Jan Białostocki died in Warsaw. By directly identifying the location mentioned in the context as the place of death, the answer is formed.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Warsaw', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'To answer the original question, I first need to determine the city where Jan Białostocki died. Since the question refers to the southern border of that city, identifying the city itself is the first necessary step. Therefore, the sub-question about the forest by the southern border of Warsaw is a logical next step, assuming Warsaw is the city in question.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'What forest is by the southern border of Warsaw?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'The flora of the city may be considered very rich in species. The species richness is mainly due to the location of Warsaw within the border region of several big floral regions comprising substantial proportions of close-to-wilderness areas (natural forests, wetlands along the Vistula) as well as arable land, meadows and forests. Bielany Forest, located within the borders of Warsaw, is the remaining part of the Masovian Primeval Forest. Bielany Forest nature reserve is connected with Kampinos Forest. It is home to rich fauna and flora. Within the forest there are three cycling and walking trails. Other big forest area is Kabaty Forest by the southern city border. Warsaw has also two botanic gardens: by the Łazienki park (a didactic-research unit of the University of Warsaw) as well as by the Park of Culture and Rest in Powsin (a unit of the Polish Academy of Science).', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context mentions that Kabaty Forest is located by the southern city border of Warsaw. Therefore, the answer is Kabaty.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Kabaty', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'Human: To determine the forest by the southern border of the city where Jan Białostocki died, first identify the city of his death, which is Warsaw. Next, find the forest located by the southern border of Warsaw, which is Kabaty. Therefore, the final answer is Kabaty.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Kabaty', '</answer>\n']}
{'id': 4661, 'user': 'SMA Negeri 68 is located in what region of the city that JKT48 was formed in?', 'assistant': ['<step>\n', 'Now that I need to determine the region of the city where JKT48 was formed, the first step is to identify the specific city in which JKT48 was formed. This will allow me to proceed to the next step of determining the region within that city where SMA Negeri 68 is located.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'In which city was JKT48 formed?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'JKT48 (read as "J. K. T. Forty-eight") is an Indonesian idol group whose name is derived from its based city of Jakarta and the Japanese idol group AKB48. Formed in 2011, it is the first AKB48 sister group outside Japan and adopts the concept of "idols you can meet", before switching to "idols that will come to meet you" since 8 April 2018. Fans can attend daily performances at the group\'s theater, which was built as a close replica to the AKB48 Theater in Akihabara.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'To form the answer, we look at the context provided. The text states that JKT48 is an Indonesian idol group whose name is derived from its based city of Jakarta and the Japanese idol group AKB48. This directly indicates that Jakarta is the city where JKT48 was formed. Therefore, the answer is Jakarta.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Jakarta', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The original question asks for the region of Jakarta where SMA Negeri 68 is located, specifically within the city where JKT48 was formed. To answer this, I first need to determine which part of Jakarta houses SMA Negeri 68, as this will help identify the correct region within the city.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'In which region of Jakarta is SMA Negeri 68 located?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'SMA Negeri 68 Jakarta (SMANED) is a public high school located at Salemba Raya street in Central Jakarta, Indonesia. The school is in one complex with SMP Negeri 216 Jakarta, SD Negeri Kenari, and Menza functional building. It was established on August 29, 1981 after being inaugurated by President Soeharto. In 2006, it was appointed to become RSBI (Rintisan Sekolah Bertaraf Internasional). Today, there are 840 students and 103 teachers and staff.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The answer is formed by identifying the location mentioned in the context. The context states that SMA Negeri 68 Jakarta is located on Salemba Raya street in Central Jakarta. Therefore, the region of Jakarta where the school is located is Central Jakarta.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Central Jakarta', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The original question asks for the region of the city where JKT48 was formed that contains SMA Negeri 68. First, we determine the city where JKT48 was formed, which is Jakarta. Next, we identify the region within Jakarta where SMA Negeri 68 is located, which is Central Jakarta. Combining these two pieces of information gives the final answer: Central Jakarta.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Central Jakarta', '</answer>\n']}
{'id': 7262, 'user': "Who did Ezequiel Astacio's team play in the world series last year?", 'assistant': ['<step>\n', "To answer the original question about who Ezequiel Astacio's team played in the world series last year, I first need to determine which team he played for, as the world series opponent would depend on that information.", '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'Which sports team did Ezequiel Astacio play for?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'Obtained by the Houston Astros from the Philadelphia Phillies in as part of the Billy Wagner trade. Astacio got a taste of the big league in posting a 3–6 record with a 5.67 ERA. He pitched 100 innings, striking out 66 and walking 25. Typical of a lot of younger pitchers with a plus fastball, he also gave up an eye opening 25 home runs. He gave up the game-winning home run to Geoff Blum in Game 3 of the 2005 World Series against the Chicago White Sox.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'Houston Astros is mentioned first in the context as the team that obtained Ezequiel Astacio in the Billy Wagner trade. This indicates that Astacio played for the Houston Astros. Therefore, the answer is Houston Astros.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Houston Astros', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', "The original question asks about the team that Ezequiel Astacio's team played in the World Series last year. Since Ezequiel Astacio is a player for the Houston Astros, the next logical step is to determine who the Houston Astros played in the World Series last year, which directly answers the original question.", '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'Who did the Houston Astros play in the World Series last year?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', "The 2017 World Series was the championship series of Major League Baseball's (MLB) 2017 season. The 113th edition of the World Series, it was played between October 24 and November 1. The series was a best - of - seven playoff between the National League (NL) champion Los Angeles Dodgers and the American League (AL) champion Houston Astros. It was sponsored by the Internet television service YouTube TV and officially known as the World Series presented by YouTube TV.", '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context states that the 2017 World Series was played between the National League champion Los Angeles Dodgers and the American League champion Houston Astros. Since the question asks who the Houston Astros played against in the World Series last year, the answer is the Los Angeles Dodgers.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Los Angeles Dodgers', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'Ezequiel Astacio played for the Houston Astros. The Houston Astros played against the Los Angeles Dodgers in the World Series last year. Therefore, the answer is Los Angeles Dodgers.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Los Angeles Dodgers', '</answer>\n']}
