{'id': 10571, 'user': 'What is the name of the major railroad related museum located in the city having the Gandhi Smriti?', 'assistant': ['<step>\n', 'The main question asks for the name of a major railroad-related museum located in the city that has the Gandhi Smriti. To answer this, I first need to identify the specific city where the Gandhi Smriti is located, as that will be the key to finding the relevant museum.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'In which city is the Gandhi Smriti located?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'Gandhi Smriti in New Delhi is the location where Mahatma Gandhi spent the last 144 days of his life and was assassinated on 30 January 1948. Rajghat is the place where Mahatma Gandhi was cremated on 31 January 1948 after his assassination and his ashes were buried and make it a final resting place beside the sanctity of the Yamuna River. The Raj Ghat in the shape of large square platform with black marble was designed by architect Vanu Bhuta.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context states that Gandhi Smriti is located in New Delhi, as it mentions that Mahatma Gandhi spent the last 144 days of his life and was assassinated there. Therefore, the answer is New Delhi.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'New Delhi', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The main question asks for the name of a major railroad-related museum located in the city that has the Gandhi Smriti. Since the Gandhi Smriti is a well-known landmark in New Delhi, the next logical step is to identify the major railroad-related museum in that city. This sub-question narrows the focus to New Delhi and the specific type of museum mentioned in the original question.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'What is the name of the major railroad-related museum located in New Delhi?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', "New Delhi is home to Indira Gandhi Memorial Museum, National Gallery of Modern Art, National Museum of Natural History, National Rail Museum, National Handicrafts and Handlooms Museum, National Philatelic Museum, Nehru Planetarium, Shankar's International Dolls Museum, and Supreme Court of India Museum.", '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context lists several museums in New Delhi, including the National Rail Museum. Since the question asks for the name of the major railroad-related museum, the answer is directly identified as National Rail Museum from the provided list.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'National Rail Museum', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The Gandhi Smriti is located in New Delhi. The major railroad-related museum in New Delhi is the National Rail Museum. Therefore, the answer is National Rail Museum.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'National Rail Museum', '</answer>\n']}
