g the Museum for the Macedonian Struggle and also for its historic churches, including those with notable mosaics. Therefore, the next step is to determine the creation date of the mosaics at the church in Thessaloniki.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'When were the mosaics at the church in Thessaloniki created?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'There are remains of floral decoration in the Church of the Acheiropoietos in Thessaloniki (5th–6th centuries).', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The context states that there are remains of floral decoration in the Church of the Acheiropoietos in Thessaloniki from the 5th–6th centuries. This directly indicates the time period when the mosaics were created. Therefore, the answer is 5th–6th centuries.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', '5th–6th centuries', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The Museum for the Macedonian Struggle is located in Thessaloniki. The mosaics at the church in Thessaloniki were created in the 5th–6th centuries. Therefore, the mosaics were created in the 5th–6th centuries.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', '5th–6th centuries', '</answer>\n']}
