rime of Korea?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'The Crime of Korea was a 1950 propaganda film produced by the US Army Signal Corps mainly concerning the war crimes committed by the North Koreans.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The answer is formed by identifying the key information in the context. The context states that "The Crime of Korea was a 1950 propaganda film produced by the US Army Signal Corps," which directly indicates the genre of the film. Therefore, the answer is "propaganda film.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'propaganda film', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'To determine the genre of the film "The Crime of the Country Divided at the End of World War II," we first identify the country that was divided at the end of World War II, which is Korea. Next, we find the genre of the film "The Crime of Korea," which is classified as a propaganda film. Therefore, the genre of the film in question is propaganda film.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'propaganda film', '</answer>\n']}
