s that Catalan is mostly situated in the Iberian Peninsula. Although it discusses linguistic similarities with other Romance languages, the key geographical information is that Catalonia is located in the Iberian Peninsula. Therefore, the answer is formed based on this direct statement from the context.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Iberian Peninsula', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The mountain of La Tossa is located in Catalonia. Catalonia is situated on the Iberian Peninsula. Therefore, the location of the region where La Tossa is found is the Iberian Peninsula.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Iberian Peninsula', '</answer>\n']}
