{'id': 2724, 'user': 'Who co-founded the developer of Intellivision?', 'assistant': ['<step>\n', 'The original question asks about the co-founder of the developer of Intellivision. To identify the co-founder, I first need to determine which company was responsible for building Intellivision. This sub-question is the first step in the reasoning chain and is essential for answering the original question.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'What company built Intellivision?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'The Intellivision is a home video game console released by Mattel Electronics in 1979. The name "Intellivision" is a portmanteau of "intelligent television". Development of the console began in 1977, the same year as the introduction of its main competitor, the Atari 2600. In 1984 Mattel sold their video game assets to a former Mattel Electronics executive and investors that would become INTV Corporation. Games development started in 1978 and continued until 1990 when the Intellivision was discontinued. From 1980 to 1983 over 3 million Intellivision units were sold.', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'Mattel Electronics built the Intellivision. The context explicitly states that the Intellivision was released by Mattel Electronics in 1979, confirming that Mattel is the company responsible for its creation.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Mattel', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'The original question asks about the co-founders of the developer of Intellivision. To answer this, I first need to identify who developed Intellivision. Since Mattel is known as the developer of Intellivision, the next step is to determine who co-founded Mattel. This sub-question provides the necessary foundation to trace back to the original question.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'Who co-founded Mattel?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'Elliot Handler (April 9, 1916 – July 21, 2011) was an American inventor, businessman, and co-founder of Mattel. With his wife, he developed some of the big