ough the years he has not only worked as a leading actor but is also a respected stage director, and was the head of Oslo Nye Teater (Oslo New Theatre) from 1967 to 1978 and most notably the head of Norway's National Theatre Nationaltheatret from 1978 to 1986. He is considered perhaps the greatest interpreter of Henrik Ibsen's 'Peer Gynt', having played the part numerous times (he even performed excerpts from the play as late as the 2002 Winter Olympic Games in Salt Lake City).", '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'The answer is formed by identifying Alfred Maurstad\'s nationality from the context. The text states that he was a "Norwegian film director and actor," which directly indicates that his country of citizenship is Norway.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', 'Norway', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'To determine the country of citizenship of the director of *En herre med bart*, first identify the director, which is Alfred Maurstad. Then, find his country of citizenship, which is Norway. Therefore, the final answer is Norway.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', 'Norway', '</answer>\n']}
