ion.', '</step>\n', '<subquery>\n', 'When did Tim McGraw release his first album?', '</subquery>\n', '<retrieval>\n', 'Tim McGraw (1993) Not a Moment Too Soon (1994) All I Want (1995) Everywhere (1997) A Place in the Sun (1999) Set This Circus Down (2001) Tim McGraw and the Dancehall Doctors (2002) Live Like You Were Dying (2004) Let It Go (2007) Southern Voice (2009) Emotional Traffic (2012) Two Lanes of Freedom (2013) Sundown Heaven Town (2014) Damn Country Music (2015) The Rest of Our Life (with Faith Hill) (2017)', '</retrieval>\n', '<step>\n', 'To determine when Tim McGraw released his first album, we examine the list of his albums and their release years. The earliest listed album is "Tim McGraw (1993)", which indicates that his first album was released in 1993. Therefore, the answer is 1993.', '</step>\n', '<subanswer>\n', '1993', '</subanswer>\n', '<step>\n', 'To determine when the performer of "If You\'re Reading This" released his first album, we first identify the performer, which is Tim McGraw. Next, we find out when Tim McGraw released his first album, which was in 1993. Therefore, the final answer is 1993.', '</step>\n', '<answer>\n', '1993', '</answer>\n']}
